        <mxCell id="fl_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Like a kitchen pass: tickets are checked before anything hits the stove.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The host verifies the plan DAG, then schedules a serial build so guest work only runs after checks pass. Prefer rich host/guest/failure vocabulary; use simple process/data/external only when rich scaffolding would be empty. ~8 content nodes; max 10. &lt;code&gt;planner/plan.go:20&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unsafe work must not start until the control plane has a trusted plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F7F7F2;strokeColor=#6B6B6B;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
